==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Snom|63}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.

===Origin===
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

